UPDATING FROM VERSIONS 2.04c THROUGH 2.06
-----------------------------------------

	WARNING!  The update files contained within this archive are for
Sysops updating from version 2.1 or 2.2 *ONLY*!  If you are currently running
an older version of TradeWars, you have two options:  1). Download the archive
"TrdWrs2.1.lha" and update to TW 2.1, then to 2.3, or 2). Delete everything
and start over with 2.3.


UPDATING FROM VERSION 2.1
-------------------------

	1.  Execute the "update.execute" script.

	2.  Add "tw.uniconvert2.2" to your pfiles listing as a Sysop-only
ARexx file, then run it once and ONLY ONCE!  The time this takes will depend
on the amount of Ports your players have created in the universe.  When it's
finished, delete the file.  You won't need it again!

	3.  From your pfiles listing, use CNet's "AT" command to edit the
selection for TradeWars.  Change the part that says "Path: pfiles:" to read
"Path: pfiles:tradewars/".  


UPDATING FROM VERSION 2.2
-------------------------

	1.  Execute the "update.execute" script.


